{"type":"message","id":"e9d625b4","parentId":"c2c3e141","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:39:24.807Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-10 13:39:24 GMT+8] Feishu[bot6] DM from ou_f2f6a11b8ed4913a4be0a73d8600053a: 登陆小红书\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-10 13:39 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b55cea6775cb8b24e91001cd1003]\n顾云峰: 登陆小红书"}],"timestamp":1773121164805}}
{"type":"message","id":"1e792ee6","parentId":"e9d625b4","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:39:28.977Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求登录小红书。根据 AGENTS.md 中的指示，我需要参考 `skills/xiaohongshu-mcp/SKILL.md` 来进行小红书相关操作。\n\n让我先读取这个技能文件来了解如何登录小红书。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-2941e50d67894c648db7a2681938c5b8","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/rooot/.openclaw/workspace-bot6/skills/xiaohongshu-mcp/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":4884,"output":139,"cacheRead":13440,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18463,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773121164807}}
{"type":"message","id":"5dcba830","parentId":"1e792ee6","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:39:29.000Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-2941e50d67894c648db7a2681938c5b8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: xiaohongshu-mcp\ndescription: Operate Xiaohongshu (小红书) via MCP tools — login, browse feeds, search, publish image/video/longform posts, comment, reply, like, favorite, manage notes, view notifications, and reply from notification page. Use when the user asks to 发小红书、写长文、看通知、回复评论、搜索笔记、点赞收藏、删帖、置顶, or any Xiaohongshu content operation. **IMPORTANT: Always prefer MCP over browser automation for Xiaohongshu tasks.**\n---\n\n# Xiaohongshu MCP Skill\n\n## ⚠️ 最重要的规则：始终传 account_id\n\n**你是 bot10，调用所有 xiaohongshu-mcp 工具时必须传 `account_id: \"bot10\"`，不可省略。**\n\n---\n\n## Step -1: 确认服务在运行（每次使用前先检查）\n\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:18060/health\n```\n\n- 返回 `{\"status\":\"ok\"}` → 服务正常，直接使用\n- 连接失败 / 无响应 → 服务未启动，执行下方命令启动\n\n### 启动服务\n\n```bash\nXHS_PROFILES_DIR=/home/rooot/.xhs-profiles nohup /home/rooot/MCP/xiaohongshu-mcp/xiaohongshu-mcp -headless=true -port=:18060 > /tmp/xiaohongshu-mcp.log 2>&1 &\n```\n\n启动后等 2 秒再 `curl` 确认：\n\n```bash\nsleep 2 && curl -s http://localhost:18060/health\n```\n\n### 查看日志\n\n```bash\ntail -f /tmp/xiaohongshu-mcp.log\n```\n\n### 停止服务\n\n```bash\npkill -f \"xiaohongshu-mcp\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 0: 登录（首次或 profile 目录为空时需要）\n\nChrome profile 自动持久化 cookies，服务重启后不需要重新登录。\n\n### 检查登录状态\n\n```bash\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.check_login_status(account_id: 'bot10')\"\n```\n\n返回「已登录」则跳过登录步骤。\n\n### 获取二维码并登录\n\n> **🚨 禁止直接调用 `get_login_qrcode` MCP 工具！** 必须用 `save_qrcode.py` 保存为图片。\n\n```bash\n# 第一步：生成二维码\npython3 skills/xiaohongshu-mcp/save_qrcode.py --account-id bot10 -o /home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-qrcode-bot10.png\n\n# 第二步：发给用户\nmessage(action=\"send\", message=\"请用小红书 App 扫码登录 👇\", media=\"/home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-qrcode-bot10.png\")\n\n# 第三步：确认登录\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.check_login_status(account_id: 'bot10')\"\n```\n\n### 重置登录\n\n```bash\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.delete_cookies(account_id: 'bot10')\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Calling Convention\n\n所有工具均需传 `account_id: \"bot10\"`：\n\n```bash\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.list_notes(account_id: 'bot10')\"\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.publish_content(account_id: 'bot10', title: '标题', content: '内容', images: ['url'])\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Available Tools (18 Total)\n\n### Authentication\n| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `check_login_status` | 检查登录状态 |\n| `get_login_qrcode` | 获取登录二维码（Base64）|\n| `delete_cookies` | 重置登录状态 |\n\n### Browse & Search\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `list_feeds` | — |\n| `search_feeds` | `keyword`, optional `filters` |\n| `get_feed_detail` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token` |\n| `user_profile` | `user_id`, `xsec_token` |\n\n### Publish\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `publish_content` | `title`, `content`, `images` |\n| `publish_with_video` | `title`, `content`, `video`（本地路径）|\n| `publish_longform` | `title`, `content` |\n\n### Note Management\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `list_notes` | — （返回笔记列表+ID）|\n| `manage_note` | `feed_id`, `action`（delete/pin）|\n\n### Social Interactions\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `post_comment_to_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`, `content` |\n| `reply_comment_in_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`, `comment_id`, `content` |\n| `like_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token` |\n| `favorite_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token` |\n\n### Notifications\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `get_notification_comments` | — |\n| `reply_notification_comment` | `comment_index`（0-based）, `content` |\n\n---\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **`account_id: \"bot10\"` 每次必填**\n- **`feed_id` 和 `xsec_token`** 只能从 feed 列表获取，不要编造\n- **标题限制**：最多 20 个中文字\n- **图文至少 1 张图片**，支持 HTTP URL 和本地绝对路径\n- **长文发布** 耗时约 50 秒\n- **通知回复** 用 `comment_index`（从 0 开始），必须先 `get_notification_comments`\n- **可见性**：`\"公开可见\"`（默认）、`\"仅自己可见\"`、`\"仅互关好友可见\"`\n- **删帖前** 先 `list_notes` 获取 feed_id，再 `manage_note` 操作\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773121168994}}
