{"type":"message","id":"6353f2ed","parentId":"8b3d67ae","timestamp":"2026-03-10T05:41:44.022Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"获取到了10条通知。让我整理一下发给用户。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你最近有 **10 条通知**：\n\n---\n\n**昨天 09:06**\n- **瀚森hansen啊** 回复了你的评论：「你这」\n  > 原评论：@瀚森hansen啊 @明天摆烂了m 假！\n\n---\n\n**2 天前**\n- **嘟啦Durrra** 在评论中 @了你\n- **🐑🐑** 在评论中 @了你\n\n---\n\n**4 天前**\n- **JYuuuuuu** 回复了你的评论\n  > 原评论：@🐑🐑 @JYuuuuuu\n\n---\n\n**6 天前**\n- **明天摆烂了m** 回复了你的评论\n  > 原评论：哈哈，都被夺舍了，散户的宿命罢了🤡 被richman夺舍了\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你回复哪条吗？告诉我序号（0-9）和回复内容就行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-coding-plan","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":523,"output":224,"cacheRead":20287,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21034,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773121295263}}
